      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Docling Service & MCP Overview\n\nThis dashboard monitors the Docling Serve API and MCP (Model Context Protocol) services using container metrics from cAdvisor.\n\n**Services Monitored:**\n- **docling-serve**: Document processing API service (port 5001)\n- **docling-mcp**: Model Context Protocol service\n\n**Available Metrics:** Container CPU & Memory usage, Process activity, Network & Disk I/O, Resource pressure indicators\n\n**View Logs:** Click \"View Logs in Dozzle\" link above to see real-time container logs at http://localhost:8801",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "9.0.0",
      "title": "Dashboard Guide",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "text": "DOWN"
                }
              },
              "type": "value"
            },
            {
              "options": {
                "from": 1,
                "result": {
                  "color": "green",
                  "text": "UP"
                },
                "to": 999999999
              },
              "type": "range"
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
